# Lighthouse CI
.lighthouseci/
# `lhci autorun` with the filesystem target also drops a report pair per run per
# URL plus a manifest.json into the working directory. .lighthouserc.cjs now
# redirects those into .lighthouseci/reports, but these patterns keep an older
# lhci version (or a bare `lhci upload`) from littering the repo root.
*.report.html
*.report.json
/manifest.json

